<Layout title="Teaching" description="Teaching by Victor A. Pinto Abarzúa: courses at USACH, undergraduate and M.Sc. thesis supervision, and curriculum design.">

<section>
  <h1>Teaching</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    I have taught university physics since 2010, at Universidad Católica del Maule, Universidad de Valparaíso, UCLA, the University of New Hampshire, and, since 2022, USACH. At the USACH Department of Physics I have served as Associate Chair for Teaching since 2025, and I took part in redesigning the Astrophysics with Data Science undergraduate program.
  </p>
</section>

